tics"},{"key":"source_status","html":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"3"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> 为非空有限集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in Q\">\\(s,t\\in Q\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R:Q\\times Q\\to\\mathsf{RegExp}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(R:Q\\times Q\\to\\mathsf{RegExp}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span>。有限列表拼接使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span> 在下式中是词列表，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span> 是状态列表。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{GLang}(Q,R,s,t)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\mathop{\\mathbin{\\frown}}_{h=1}^{m}u(h):m\\in\\mathbb N,\\ q:\\{0,\\ldots,m\\}\\to Q,\\ u:\\{1,\\ldots,m\\}\\to\\Sigma^*,\\ q(0)=s,\\ q(m)=t,\\ \\forall h\\in\\{1,\\ldots,m\\}\\;u(h)\\in⟦ R(q(h-1),q(h))⟧_\\Sigma\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{GLang}(Q,R,s,t)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\mathop{\\mathbin{\\frown}}_{h=1}^{m}u(h):m\\in\\mathbb N,\\ q:\\{0,\\ldots,m\\}\\to Q,\\ u:\\{1,\\ldots,m\\}\\to\\Sigma^*,\\ q(0)=s,\\ q(m)=t,\\ \\forall h\\in\\{1,\\ldots,m\\}\\;u(h)\\in⟦ R(q(h-1),q(h))⟧_\\Sigma\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>每条边读一个由其正则项表示的词，因而可读空词。m=0 的路径仅在 s=t 时贡献 ε。这里不预设“边读单字符”，也不把图上的标签树直接当作语言。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-regex-denotation","status":"resolved","id":"d47feb8e4b903a2e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-regex-denotation]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)$；$Q$ 为非空有限集，$s,t\\in Q$，$R:Q\\times Q\\to\\mathsf{RegExp}_{\\Sigma}$。有限列表拼接使用 [[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]；$u$ 在下式中是词列表，$q$ 是状态列表。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"Q","display":false},{"tex":"s,t\\in Q","display":false},{"tex":"R:Q\\times Q\\to\\mathsf{RegExp}_{\\Sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"u","display":false},{"tex":"q","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{GLang}(Q,R,s,t)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\mathop{\\mathbin{\\frown}}_{h=1}^{m}u(h):m\\in\\mathbb N,\\ q:\\{0,\\ldots,m\\}\\to Q,\\ u:\\{1,\\ldots,m\\}\\to\\Sigma^*,\\ q(0)=s,\\ q(m)=t,\\ \\forall h\\in\\{1,\\ldots,m\\}\\;u(h)\\in⟦ R(q(h-1),q(h))⟧_\\Sigma\\right\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1540,"backlinks":[{"id":"df01a174cec84896","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$Q,R,s,t$ 采用 [[73-df-generalized-automaton-language]]，$k\\in Q\\setminus\\{s,t\\}$，$i,j\\in Q\\setminus\\{k\\}$。"},{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-38","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-generalized-automaton-language|正则项标号图的路径语言]] （本轮新建）"}],"outgoing":["d47feb8e4b903a2e","0a